{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47905","headline":"霅溪夜宴诗 二 · 水神","name":"霅溪夜宴诗 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悲风淅淅兮波緜緜，芦花万里兮凝苍烟。\n虬螭窟宅兮渊且玄，排波叠浪兮沈我天。\n所覆不全兮身宁全，溢眸恨血兮徒涟涟。\n誓将柔荑抉锯牙之喙，空水府而藏其腥涎。\n青娥翠黛兮沈江壖，碧云斜月兮空婵娟。\n吞声饮恨兮语无力，徒扬哀怨兮登歌筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"水神","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}